    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Add an A3 1P1D deployment section with a Memcache KV Cache Pool to the
    DeepSeek-V4-Flash model guide on main. This is the main-branch
    counterpart of #19615, including the updated parameter alignment and
    removal of the incorrect layerwise-pooling limitation.
    
    All non-pooling parameters follow main's existing `A3 series with
    dspark` PD example in Section 5.2.1: DP2/TP1/PCP8 Prefill and DP16/TP1
    Decode, including HCCL settings, batch sizes, memory utilization,
    speculative decoding, additional configuration, and Mooncake connector
    settings. The section adds Memcache service configurations,
    MultiConnector/AscendStoreConnector integration, pooling environment
    variables and Prefill prefix caching, startup order, proxy endpoint
    mapping, and pool-reuse verification.
    
    Memcache setup follows the DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash section and Ascend Store
    feature guide, with deployment scripts used as an operational reference.
    Environment-specific addresses and paths are replaced with placeholders.
    
